WEBVTT

00:04:29.473 --> 00:04:31.267
You can use them to look at something

00:04:31.267 --> 00:04:36.105
which is completely different
from either Wall Street or Tajikistan.

00:04:36.105 --> 00:04:38.024
The world of dogs.

00:04:39.191 --> 00:04:42.945
This is my dog, Charlie.

00:04:42.945 --> 00:04:45.948
Adorable, smelly, out of control.

00:04:46.824 --> 00:04:50.328
And when people ask me
about my dog, I often say,

00:04:50.369 --> 00:04:52.913
"Charlie, she's part of my family."

00:04:52.955 --> 00:04:57.376
I bet many of you who have dogs
will say exactly the same thing.

00:04:58.586 --> 00:05:00.588
But here's something to think about.